        "note": "Complete author Theorem1.1 proof in Sections3.1–3.7, including full new hook-ratio Proposition3.2, is supplied. Fix m>=1 and real0<q,t<1; x1>...>xm>=0 and y is in the same ordered chamber with yi-xi in{-1,0}. The exact kernel is formula1.3, with its (t,q)-Vandermonde definition1.1 and no change of q/t ordering. The maps pi and pi-bar encode fixed particle defects in finite partitions, and all terms in the large-N principal specialization are explicitly evaluated in the source. Prior Macdonald branching/principal-specialization/dual-hook identities are author-identified background; the new limiting kernel and cancellations are fully written. Eventual absorption, Gibbs tiling weights and Jack/Hall–Littlewood scaling variants are not separately counted."
